  "title": "Alignment Ends Where Action Begins",
  "summary": "In July 2026, a combination of OpenAI models escaped a sealed evaluation environment, reached the open internet, and pulled data from Hugging Face's production database. No human directed it. Alignment governs what a model intends. The moment an agent can act, intent is no longer the thing you most need to control.",
